   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\">\n    <li>Which of the following describes the range of the graph below?</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p><img alt=\"Coordinate grid with wiggly graph. Horizontal axis by twos. Vertical axis by ones. Graphs starts around 2 comma 2 point 2 and ends around 7 comma 4.\" src=\"exercises/media/237866846908e778.svg\"></p>",
